  fetching funding history…

FUNDING AT SIGNAL TIME — does it predict anything?
59 symbols · 333 days · Min15+Min30+Min60
9071 sent, 2905 picked · funding matched on 7964 (88%)
funding range: -0.01008 … +0.00232 per 8h (median +0.000037)

Each direction is measured against ITS OWN baseline, because shorts
out-scored longs in every bucket and comparing the two columns would
only restate that. THE SIGNATURE OF REAL POSITIONING INFORMATION is
that as funding rises the long delta and the short delta move in
OPPOSITE directions. Both drifting the same way is a shared regime,
which is how the exhaustion study died.

